Worked example:

```javascript
function readLimit(target) {
  const values = new URL(target, "https://example.test").searchParams.getAll("limit");
  return values.length === 1 ? values[0] : null;
}
console.log(readLimit("/notes?limit=2"));
```
The returned value is "2".

